module "compute" {
  source = "../../modules/compute"
  
  instance_type = var.instance_type
  key_name      = var.key_name
  security_groups = [aws_security_group.monitoring.id]
}
```

**User Data Script** (`modules/compute/user_data.sh`):
- Installs all dependencies (Docker, Nginx, etc.)
- Downloads monitoring binaries from GitHub
- Configures systemd services
- Runs background setup scripts with nohup

**Monitoring Setup** (`scripts/monitoring-setup.sh`):
- Downloads Loki, Promtail, Grafana binaries
- Creates directories and user accounts
- Configures systemd services
- Sets up auto-start and auto-restart

